sequenceDiagram
  actor P as Person
  participant B as Board card (React view)
  participant H as Host (Claude, ChatGPT, ...)
  participant A as Assistant
  participant S as Game server (Hono)
  P->>B: clicks row 1, column 2
  B->>H: play_move(X, expectedMoveNumber 0)
  H->>S: play_move
  S-->>H: game, move 1, O to play
  H-->>B: result to the calling action (onSuccess)
  B->>B: show X, squares disabled
  B->>H: appendMessage("I played X ... Your move.")
  H->>A: the person's message
  A->>H: play_move(O, expectedMoveNumber 1)
  H->>S: play_move
  S-->>H: game, move 2, X to play
  H-->>A: result (no card opened)
  loop bounded wait, about every 1.5 s
    B->>H: show_game
    H->>S: show_game
    S-->>H: game, move 2
    H-->>B: result to the waiting board
  end
  B->>B: show O, squares enabled for X
  Note over B,S: A stale card or repeated request sends an old expectedMoveNumber.<br/>The server refuses it with no effect and returns the current game.
